OpenRappter Desktop distributes FFmpeg and FFprobe executables from
`@ffmpeg-installer/ffmpeg` and `@ffprobe-installer/ffprobe` for local media
transcription. Those executables are licensed under LGPL-2.1 and are invoked as
separate processes. Their package license files are preserved in the packaged
application.
